; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 26. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'wa79_kara'
wa79_kara.dialogstring_07A811! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That thing that[N]they call a Kruk is a[N]weird animal, isn't it…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_erik'
wa79_erik.dialogstring_07A4C8! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: There's a full moon[N]tonight.[WAI][N]Somehow, towns always feel[N]a little different under[N]a full moon.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_neil'
wa79_neil.dialogstring_07A255! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: There's a vast[N]desert west of here.[WAI][N]We can't cross it on foot.[N]We'll need Kruks.[WAI][N]The question is where to[N]find some[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_lily'
wa79_lily.dialogstring_07AA34! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: It'd be nice if[N]Lance's father could get[N]well quickly, wouldn't it?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_lance'
wa79_lance.dialogstring_07ADA9! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I gave tha medicine[N]to my old man just now.[FIN]I think he'll slowly[N]recover after this…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa78_moving_woman'
wa78_moving_woman.dialogstring_07846A! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]Woman: A girl in pink was[N]making a wish on that[N]lotus leaf a moment ago.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa78_glass_game'
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0796A9! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]This is where we meet for[N]Russian Glass.[N]Are you participating?[WAI][N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0796DE! `[CLR]Alright, in that case, go[N]home. Then forget[N]everything you saw here.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079704! `[CLR]You're really wagering[N]your life on Russian[N]Glass?![FIN]This is not a harmless[N]game.[FIN]I'll ask once more.[N]Do you truly accept the[N]risk?[WAI][N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_07977A! `[CLR]Very well. The one[N]standing there is the[N]opponent you're competing[N]against.[FIN]He's a veteran of this[N]game. I've never seen a[N]human being with luck[N]like his.[FIN]Alright. You may ask him[N]about the rules.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0797E6! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]Another young life will be[N]reduced to ashes tonight…[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079610! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]There is no other game as[N]exciting as this. I'm[N]shaking.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0795B9! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]How can you bet your life[N]like this? You're still[N]young.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079835! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]You have courage, don't[N]you?[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_07986C! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]It seems that your[N]opponent has earned a lot[N]of money through this[N]game.[FIN]I wonder what in the[N]world he's using it for…[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0792F7! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]Competitor: Hmph. You're[N]barely old enough to know[N]what a life is worth.[WAI][N]The rules are simple.[N]One of five glasses holds[N]poison.[WAI][N]We take turns drinking.[N]The last person alive[N]wins. I'll go first.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0793B6! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]Competitor:[N]Raaaaaaaaagh[AD]!![FIN][CLD][DEF][SFX:0]The competitor drains the[N]contents of the glass in[N]one gulp[AD][END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079922! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](This glass looks dark[N]red, almost like blood.)[FIN](Is this strange power[N]in my body warning me[AD]?)[FIN](Should I drink it?)[N][PAL:0] Yes[N] No[PAL:4]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079992! `[CLR]Will: I'll skip this[N]glass…[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0799AF! `[CLR]Will: My body[N]is getting numb…[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_0798E8! `[DEF]Will closes his eyes and[N]drinks the glass in one[N]swallow.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079401! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]Competitor: Humph…! You're[N]damn lucky… I guess it's[N]my turn next.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079422! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]Competitor: Hey, it's[N]your turn! Don't lose your[N]nerve and run away![END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_07944D! `[BOR:9][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]Competitor: One glass[N]left[AD][WAI][CLD][PAU:3C][BOR:9][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C][DLY:2]Spectator: It's over![N]The boy won![FIN][DLY:0]Spectator: Stop! You[N]don't have to drink it![FIN][CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24][DLY:3]Competitor: No.[PAU:1E] I won't[N]crawl away in shame.[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:0][DLY:2]The man lifts the final[N]glass.[END]`
wa78_glass_game.dialogstring_079520! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]Spectator: Put it down![N]You've already lost![FIN][CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]There's no need to hurry[N]toward death![FIN][CLD][DEF][SFX:0]Ignoring the crowd, the[N]man drains the glass.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa7D_glass_opponent'
wa7D_glass_opponent.dialogstring_078E2D! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]Woman: You were my[N]husband's opponent in[N]Russian Glass, weren't[N]you?[FIN]He told me he'd found good[N]work and that I shouldn't[N]worry.[FIN]I never imagined this was[N]what he meant.[FIN]He left this letter marked[N]"To My Opponent."[N]Please read it.[FIN]There are four Kruks[N]outside. He wanted you to[N]have them.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa78_women'
wa78_women.dialogstring_078B3B! `[CLD][BOR:9][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1C]Woman: We never needed[N]money that badly.[WAI][N]Being beside someone you[N]love is its own kind of[N]good fortune.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039696! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Will gently opens and[N]reads the will.[FIN][CLD][BOR:1][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24] [N]      To My Opponent[N] [FIN][CLD][BOR:1][DLG:3,B][SIZ:D,7][PRT:@RetranslationTheme24]If I die, do not mourn me[N]or blame yourself.[N]Russian Glass did not put[N]me at death's door.[N]An incurable illness did[N]that half a year ago.[FIN]I became obsessed with[N]earning as much money as[N]I could before I died.[N]I wanted my wife and the[N]child I will never meet to[N]be safe after I was gone.[FIN]But much of the money I[N]earned came from work that[N]made other people suffer.[N]I told myself it was for[N]my family. That did not[N]make the harm disappear.[FIN]So I chose this final[N]wager. Foolish, perhaps,[N]but mine to choose.[FIN]If you defeat me, take my[N]four beloved Kruks. And[N]spend whatever life you[N]have better than I did.[FIN]P.S. Don't tell my wife[N]about the illness or my[N]regrets. It will be easier[N]for her to move on if part[N]of her resents me.[FIN]I want her to find[N]happiness again, and[N]regrets and my ghost would[N]only haunt her if she[N]knew.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa78_prize_kruk'
wa78_prize_kruk.dialogstring_079B30! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](These must be the Kruks[N]the letter mentioned.)[FIN](I need to tell everyone[N]what happened.)[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_kara'
wa79_kara.dialogstring_07A833! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They say Neil[N]wasn't born in any old[N]house.[FIN]His family runs a trading[N]company from their mansion[N]in the town of Euro.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_erik'
wa79_erik.dialogstring_07A506! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Why do we have to[N]part with Lance and Lilly[N]now…?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_lance'
wa79_lance.dialogstring_07ADEA! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I'm sorry, but I'm[N]stayin' here.[WAI][N]I can't just leave that[N]old man of mine.[WAI][N]And after that[AD] [PAU:78]Uh, I[N]guess I'm feelin' shy or[N]somethin'[AD][WAI][N]The thing is, I'm goin'[N]out with Lilly.[WAI][N]I ain't kiddin' about how[N]I feel. We wanna stay[N]together for a while.[WAI][N]And Lilly says she wants[N]that too.[WAI][N]Travelin' with everyone[N]was fun. You all take[N]care, alright?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_lily'
wa79_lily.dialogstring_07AA5E! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I'm staying in[N]this town too.[WAI][N]As for why[AD][N]Well, ask Lance.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'wa79_neil'
wa79_neil.dialogstring_07A2BE! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Four Kruks?[N]Those are worth a fortune.[WAI][N][AD]You look like there's a[N]story behind them.[N]I won't pry.[WAI][N]We were planning to head[N]west toward Euro next.[WAI][N]But Lance and Lilly say[N]they're staying here.[N]Ask them why.[END]`
wa79_neil.dialogstring_07A366! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I think that the[N]moment where a boy and a[N]girl develop feelings for[N]each other is wonderful[N]and magical.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I want to believe that[N]we'll never forget this[N]feeling.[FIN]Anyway. My parents' house[N]is in Euro, isn't it?[FIN]I think we'll familiarize[N]ourselves with Will's power[N]somehow if we go there.[FIN]Alright, let's head out to[N]Euro…!![END]`
